<title>BELGIUM: EU limits validity of cereal export licences.</title>
<headline>EU limits validity of cereal export licences.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has limited the validity of cereal-based processed product export licences for June to the end of the month, an announcement in the European Union's official journal said on Friday.</p>
<p>Licences are normally valid for an additional four weeks after their period of validity but the announcement in the journal, received on Monday but published on Friday, said customs formalities must be completed by June 30 at the latest.</p>
</text>
